text:
{First person}

Three men sit on a bench, enjoying the warm sun on their faces. One man, a young professional, is on his lunch break, scrolling through his phone. The second man, a middle-aged artist, is sketching the scenery in front of him, while the third man, an elderly retired teacher, is reading a book.

